    "与安卓相同：从一段文字中识别任务（快速添加的「AI 识别」）时，这段话会附在原文之前，例如「默认截止时间为当天 23:59」「课程名放在标题开头」。留空则不附加。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Like on Android: when AI recognizes tasks from a piece of text (“AI Recognize” in Quick Add), this text is placed before it, e.g. “Default deadline is 23:59 that day” or “Put the course name at the start of the title”. Leave empty to add nothing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "与安卓相同：复制了别人分享的任务链接后切回 Deadliner，会询问是否添加。macOS 可能会先询问是否允许 Deadliner 读取剪贴板；只在剪贴板里是网址时才读取。不开启时，可以用菜单「编辑 → 从剪贴板导入分享链接」（⇧⌘V）。在任务的右键菜单中选「复制分享链接」，可以分享给手机或其他人。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Like on Android: after you copy a task link someone shared and switch back to Deadliner, you'll be asked whether to add it. macOS may first ask whether Deadliner may read the clipboard; it's only read when the clipboard contains a web address. When off, use “Edit → Import Share Link from Clipboard” (⇧⌘V). Choose “Copy Share Link” in a task's context menu to share it with your phone or other people."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "与安卓相同：每天固定时间推送一条通知，显示今天到期、已逾期和进行中的任务数，点开进入概览。需要先启用通知。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Like on Android: a daily notification at a fixed time shows how many tasks are due today, overdue and in progress; click it to open Overview. Notifications must be enabled first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "与手机相同：点按卡片先查看详情（时间进度、备注、子任务），在详情中再编辑。关闭后点按卡片直接打开编辑窗口。右键菜单中两者都有。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Like on the phone: clicking a card first shows the details (time progress, notes, subtasks), where you can edit. When off, clicking a card opens the editor directly. Both are in the context menu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
