    "到期和习惯提醒由 Core 计算，与手机一致；临近提醒默认提前 1 天，可以改成提前几小时或几天（只在这台 Mac 上）。23:59 截止的任务原本在午夜前后提醒，开启后改在白天时间提醒（临近提醒移到它所在那天的白天）。同一时刻的多条任务提醒会合并成一条。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Due and habit reminders are computed by Core, the same as on the phone. The due-soon reminder defaults to 1 day ahead and can be changed to a number of hours or days (this Mac only). Tasks due at 23:59 would normally be reminded around midnight; when on, they're reminded during the day instead (the due-soon reminder moves to the daytime of that day). Several task reminders at the same moment are combined into one."
          }
        }
      }
    },
