    "在 %@ 没有找到同步文件。\n\n如果手机已经在使用同步，通常是服务器地址不一致（例如少了一层文件夹）。请对照手机「云与同步 → WebDAV」中的地址。\n\n只有这是第一台开始同步的设备时，才选择「新建同步文件」。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No sync file was found at %@.\n\nIf your phone already syncs, the server address usually differs (for example, one folder level is missing). Compare it with the address under “Cloud & Sync → WebDAV” on your phone.\n\nChoose “Create Sync File” only if this is the first device to start syncing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在 Deadliner 中新建一个任务。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
