            "value": "Create a new task in Deadliner."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在任务或习惯中开始专注；右键记录可以调整时长或删除": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start a focus session from a task or habit; right-click a record to change its duration or delete it"
