        }
      }
    },
    "在任务或习惯的编辑窗口中点「开始专注」后自动关闭编辑窗口，只留下计时窗。编辑窗口中未保存的修改不会保存。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After clicking “Start Focus” in a task or habit editor, close the editor and keep only the timer window. Unsaved changes in the editor are not saved."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在任务页只看这个分类": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show only this category on the Tasks page"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在任务页顶部显示一句鼓励的话，每分钟换一句。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show an encouraging line at the top of the Tasks page, changing every minute."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在所有窗口最上层显示正在进行的任务和今天的习惯（分两组）。「第一次打开电脑」指每天第一次启动、唤醒或解锁这台 Mac，需要 Deadliner 正在运行或已设为开机自启。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shows active tasks and today's habits (in two groups) above all windows. “First time you open the computer” means the first launch, wake or unlock of this Mac each day; Deadliner must be running or set to open at login."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在菜单栏显示 Deadliner": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show Deadliner in the menu bar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在菜单栏查看今天到期、逾期和习惯进度，点击打开面板。样式和面板内容都可以在设置中调整。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "See what's due today, overdue and your habit progress in the menu bar; click to open the panel. The style and panel content can be changed in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在访达中显示": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show in Finder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "地址格式不正确": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The address is invalid"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "坚果云：地址填 https://dav.jianguoyun.com/dav/ 加上与手机相同的文件夹，密码使用「第三方应用管理」中生成的应用密码。同步文件与手机相同：<地址>/Deadliner/kmp-changelog-v1.json。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nutstore (Jianguoyun): use https://dav.jianguoyun.com/dav/ plus the same folder as on your phone, and the app password generated under “Third-party app management”. The sync file is the same as on the phone: <address>/Deadliner/kmp-changelog-v1.json."
          }
        }
      }
    },
