          }
        }
      }
    },
    "完成活动与当前状态": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Completion activity and current status"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "完成活动按实际完成日期；待办、逾期、放弃及指标按截止日期。指标中的逾期沿用 Core 未完成口径，含放弃。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Completion activity uses the actual completion date; to-dos, overdue, abandoned and metrics use the deadline. Overdue in the metrics follows Core's not-completed rule and includes abandoned tasks."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "完成率": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Completion rate"
          }
        }
      }
    },
