      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Import"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "导入 %lld 个": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Import %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "导入 Deadliner 的任务分享链接（与安卓格式相同），在应用中确认后添加。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Import a Deadliner task share link (same format as Android) and add it after confirming in the app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "导入…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Import…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "导入分享链接": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Import Share Link"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "导入前会把当前数据自动保存到本机。\n\n启用同步时，导入不会删除手机或云端的数据：下次同步会按修改时间合并，云端较新的内容会保留。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Before importing, your current data is saved on this Mac automatically.\n\nWith sync on, importing doesn't delete data on your phone or in the cloud: the next sync merges by modification time, and newer cloud content is kept."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "导入前自动备份": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatic backup before import"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "导入后成为新的任务：截止时间是事件的结束时间（全天事件为当天 23:59）。日历中的事件不会改动。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each event becomes a new task: the deadline is the event's end time (23:59 that day for all-day events). Events in your calendar are not changed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "导入备份": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Import Backup"
          }
        }
      }
    },
